  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The product contains all the non-3D printed parts for assembling an entirely functional Gamma Fist. To complete the work, you also need to download the model files and 3D print the remaining parts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Creator Program: The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "To download the model files please visit the Gamma Fist on MakerWorld."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\"><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Overview</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The product contains all the <strong>non-3D printed</strong> parts for assembling an entirely functional <strong>Gamma Fist</strong>. To complete the work, you also need to download the <strong>model files</strong> and <strong>3D print</strong> the remaining parts.<span></span></p>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">Creator Program</span><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">:</span></em></strong></span><strong><em> </em></strong>The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs.</div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4OCdHYOOop5aGxqeiFcWXYnnXe\"><span>To download the model files</span><span> please visit the </span><strong>Gamma Fist </strong><span>on </span><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/569516#profileId-489456\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong><u>MakerWorld</u></strong></span></a><span>.</span></div>\n<!-- 第四条 -->\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"></h3>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">In the Box</h3>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"height: 95px;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 483.42px;\"><strong>Item</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 48.6285px;\"><strong>Qty</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 483.42px;\">\n<div>\n<div data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-zone-id=\"0\">\n<p>D10x3 mm Round Magnet (20PCS) - CA009</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"lark-record-clipboard\" data-lark-record-data='{\"rootId\":\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\",\"text\":{\"initialAttributedTexts\":{\"text\":{\"0\":\"Button\"},\"attribs\":{\"0\":\"*0+6\"}},\"apool\":{\"numToAttrib\":{\"0\":[\"author\",\"7118919285765865474\"]},\"nextNum\":1}},\"type\":\"text\",\"referenceRecordMap\":{},\"extra\":{\"mention_page_title\":{},\"external_mention_url\":{}},\"isKeepQuoteContainer\":false,\"isFromCode\":false,\"selection\":[{\"id\":64,\"type\":\"text\",\"selection\":{\"start\":0,\"end\":6},\"recordId\":\"WN9wdvxjroLLKUxZrwrcWzjZnhd\"}],\"payloadMap\":{},\"isCut\":false}' data-lark-record-format=\"docx/text\"></span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 48.6285px;\">1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 第五条 --></div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "The product contains all the non-3D printed parts for assembling an entirely functional Gamma Fist. To complete the work, you also need to download the model files and 3D print the remaining parts.\n\nCreator Program: The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs.\n\nTo download the model files please visit the Gamma Fist on MakerWorld.",
